0
XEQ "PICF"
RTN
LBL 03               @@@@ Action for menu key XRNG
FUNC 00
FS? 64
GTO 10               @@@@ For shift we just display settings
X≠Y?
GTO 24
X=0?
GTO 26
@@@@ Code for LLIM=ULIM≠0
RCL "ULIM"
RCL- "LLIM"
2
÷
×
RCL "ULIM"
RCL+ "LLIM"
2
÷
RCL ST X
RCL ST Z
-
STO "LLIM"
R↓
+
STO "ULIM"
GTO 10
LBL 26
@@@@ Code for LLIM=ULIM=0
CLV "LLIM"
CLV "ULIM"
XEQ 74
GTO 10
